Output public/pages/prompts/swarm/scene.mp4
Source tapes/common/settings.tape
Set TypingSpeed 39ms

Hide
Type "node scenes/run.mjs pages/prompts/swarm"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "/subagents on"
Enter
Sleep 1900ms
# cue: start
Type "/swarm Check plain and shout greetings"
Sleep 350ms
Enter
Sleep 4100ms
# cue: gap
Sleep 6100ms
# cue: retry
Sleep 2600ms
# cue: result
Sleep 7400ms
